ANNOUNCEMENT : LLG Members Meeting

Anyone interested in lojban is welcome, and there are other activities on
this such as bridges to several common chats about and /or in it.

2021 LLG Members Meeting

Place: Mattermost (same as recent meetings - instructions for those new to
it follow).

Start Date: October 25th, 2021 @ 00:01 UTC

Please, please if you plan on attending any of all of this meeting please
join the meeting and state you are present by the end of October 31st.
Thank you. This m meeting is expected to finish by the end of January at
the latest so general organizational business will be moved along quickly.

-------

Email karis at comcaresvcs@gmail.com with any questions not answered below.

-------

How to join Mattermost:

In order to join the discussion at Mattermost, you'll need to first sign up
( https://framateam.org/signup_email ) and then click the invite link (
https://framateam.org/signup_user_complete/?id=3D17b4ir6u6by6px693dm8kmy7yw=
 ).

Often entering out team works, so feel free to try www.framateam.org/lojban=
.

The interface is in French, but once you get inside, you can change the
system language to English (or Spanish). Here are a few translations to get
you through the sign-up part:

Quelle est votre adresse e-mail ? =3D What's your email address?

Sp=C3=A9cifiez votre nom d'utilisateur =3D Specify your username.

Sp=C3=A9cifiez votre mot de passe =3D Specify your password.

Cr=C3=A9er un compte =3D Create an account.

(special thanks to Mike S for putting this together)

When you are finished with that open Mattermost with
www.framateam.org/lojban.

